<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki sees higher full-yr 1997 EPS.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki sees higher full-yr 1997 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish packaging and confectionery group Huhtamaki Oy on Tuesday repeated it expected an improvement in full-year 1997 earnings per share.</p>
<p>&quot;Overall, Huhtamaki's outlook is sound, and an improvement in full-year earnings per share is expected,&quot; the company said in a statement with its January-April results.</p>
<p>&quot;The relatively comfortable start for 1997 has not changed the full-year outlook,&quot; Huhtamaki said.</p>
</text>
